Source-only adaptation of accepted RAD01 build-prep03 (the three physical
scripts are in RAD01 build-prep02). This proposal changes the existing
configure/build, derive/correspondence and metadata-completion stages. It adds
no QA stage and invokes no engine. The reviewed consumer03 producer remains
unchanged. Root and an independent source reviewer must review this hold
before Root executes these adapters.

